DESCRIPTION:Board games for Seniors \nJoin us for a fun-filled afternoon of games\, laughter\, and bonding! \n\nAll seniors are welcome\nGet a chance to win great prizes\nSnacks & beverages provided\nTTC tickets provided\n\nFor more information: Please contact Shane at 437-488-8960
