SUMMARY:Life in Canada: When Life in your New Home Changes How you See Yourself
DESCRIPTION:Life in a new country can be different from what you expected. Explore common challenges and changes\, and learn practical ways to adjust and move forward. \nFacilitated by: Anna Klimentova (MSW\, RSW) \nRecognize the strengths you brought with you and rebuild your confidence as life changes. \nTo register\, please fill out this FORM. \nTHIS IS A VIRTUAL EVENT. \nWho can participate: Newcomer Adults who are Permanent Residents or Convention Refugees \nTo register\, contact Daniel Tai via stai@culturelink.ca.
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/when-life-in-your-new-home-changes-how-you-see-yourself/
LOCATION:Ontario
CATEGORIES:Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Newcomer-Wellness-Program-Web-Icon.png
END:VEVENT
