SUMMARY:Mentor Orientation Session
DESCRIPTION:Become a mentor and support a newcomer navigate life in Canada. \nWhat you will do:\n• Support someone’s journey\n• Build connections across cultures and communities\n• Develop leadership\, communication\, and mentoring skills\n• Gain valuable volunteer experience \nBefore you commit\, Register for a Mentor Orientation Session (Online) and learn about the commitment\, and the support we provide. \n 
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/mentor-orientation-session-2026-11-04/
LOCATION:Online
CATEGORIES:Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Icon-Become-a-Mentor-2026.png
END:VEVENT
