SUMMARY:Parenting Together: Raising Children Between Two Cultures
DESCRIPTION:Join us and get practical parenting strategies\, share experiences\, and build confidence as you raise your family in a new environment. You’re not alone. \nFacilitated by: Michel Zamora\nRegistered Psychotherapist\nVoyage Couples Therapy \nHelp your child balance two cultures\, build a positive identity\, and stay connected to their cultural roots while growing up in Canada. \nWho can participate: Newcomer Parents who are Permanent Residents or Convention Refugees. \nTo register\, fill out this FORM. \nTHIS IS A VIRTUAL EVENT. \nTo register\, contact Kristina via ktalalaievska@culturelink.ca.
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/parenting-together-raising-children-between-two-cultures/
LOCATION:Ontario
CATEGORIES:Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Newcomer-Wellness-Program-Web-Icon.png
END:VEVENT
