SUMMARY:Zumba Gold for Seniors
DESCRIPTION:Move\, groove\, make new friends\, and feel great!  \nJoin us for a fun Zumba Gold session and enjoy the Latin music. \n\nLed by a Zumba instructor \nNo dance experience required \nSnacks and beverages provided \nTTC tickets provided \n\nCome enjoy the music\, get moving\, and connect with others in a welcoming and friendly environment. \nFor more information: Please contact Shane at 437-488-8960
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/zumba-gold-for-seniors/2026-11-06/
