SUMMARY:Picnic in High Park
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a relaxing picnic in High Park! \nEnjoy a good vibe\, great conversations \nLovely afternoon connecting with fellow newcomers in Toronto \n\nFor Permanent residents and Convention Refugees. \nTo register please fill the form  \nOr contact Karen at kau-yeung@culturelink.ca or call 416-986-4219 
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/picnic-in-high-park/
LOCATION:High Park\, Hillside Gardens\, 1873 Bloor St W\,\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6R 2Z3\, Canada
